 class="Footer-module-scss-module__EzUeIG__logo"><img alt="logo" data-cy="image" loading="lazy" width="128" height="128" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/2xv0kTwb8EIFCrjSQgxlmN/d1962f3259fd7cb5481ff884ab484c4b/monday-logo-square.png?w=128&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/2xv0kTwb8EIFCrjSQgxlmN/d1962f3259fd7cb5481ff884ab484c4b/monday-logo-square.png?w=256&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/2xv0kTwb8EIFCrjSQgxlmN/d1962f3259fd7cb5481ff884ab484c4b/monday-logo-square.png?w=256&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/></div><div><div class="Footer-module-scss-module__EzUeIG__text"><p class="p xs fw-medium">&quot;Intent and signal data to reach the right companies at the right time.&quot;</p><p class="p xs">monday.com</p></div></div></div><div><div class="Footer-module-scss-module__EzUeIG__logo"><img alt="logo" data-cy="image" loading="lazy" width="128" height="128" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" srcSet="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/6yCGeu9qQS0FrTK4M5Ho1/6f1d0740019cbe4b7fce878be299a903/capitalone-logo-square.png?w=128&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 1x, https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/6yCGeu9qQS0FrTK4M5Ho1/6f1d0740019cbe4b7fce878be299a903/capitalone-logo-square.png?w=256&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp 2x" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/6yCGeu9qQS0FrTK4M5Ho1/6f1d0740019cbe4b7fce878be299a903/capitalone-logo-square.png?w=256&amp;q=75&amp;fm=webp"/></div><div><div class="Footer-module-scss-module__EzUeIG__text"><p class="p xs fw-medium">&quot;One intent signal led to a meeting, a deal, and 25% of my yearly quota&quot;</p><p class="p xs"> Capital One</p></div></div></div><div><div class="Footer-module-scss-module__EzUeIG__logo"><img alt="logo" data-cy="image" loading="lazy" width="32" height="32" decoding="async" data-nimg="1" style="color:transparent" src="https://images.ctfassets.net/kyld7105l6mt/2EccJK9s1D